            "notes": "**POWER**\n---\n[Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) is important to keep you in the race for as long as possible.\n\n---\n**ITEMS**\n---\nRound 1 is a basic one. Start with [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for surviving. If your aim is good, getting [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) will help you out too!\n\n[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) is good to boosting healing on both yourself and team mates if you dont want to rely on aiming to survive!\n\n*Focus on healing and doing damage, farming money is important!*",
