            "notes": "**POWERS**\n-- \n[Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) is the core of this build. This skill is both a great mobility skill and an attack skill. \n\n---\n**ITEMS**\n--\n[Hiking Hoverboots](item_158611dd-147a-4375-a16a-565aa4f5f7de) is a MUST have at this point. This is the bread and putter of your build. I'd recommend getting familiar with some of the movement options that the kick and glide give you!\n\nNow we are getting [Golden Monk](item_559b91a0-840b-4027-b99c-c5e6b609ae7c). At this point you'll already have a 15% increase of melee damage, which as Zen is really, really strong. \n\nYou can also pick [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) here, but we are picking that up next round anyway, so it's entirely your pick. Whatever you feel is better right now.\n\n[Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) is a great item too. If you got room and enough cash, thats the item you want for EVERY round from here on out with exception of the final round.",
