            "created_at": "2025-09-26T08:04:52.041673+00:00",
            "notes": "**ITEMS**\n--\nwith [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) (or [Golden Monk](item_559b91a0-840b-4027-b99c-c5e6b609ae7c) if you already have Gloom) you are able to start getting in some pretty wacky 1 vs 1's, leaving the enemy team scratching their heads about the fury of kicks that came their way!\n\n**What you gotta do in fights is:**\n\n1x primary fire -> 1x kick -> 1x primary fire -> 1x kick -> *RINSE AND REPEAT!*\n\nYou can use the jumpkicks as much as you'd like for extra damage output but you can also use it to disengage! Kicking against a wall **stuns** the opponent and is a great way to get a few free headshots in.\n\nGetting [Hiking Hoverboots](item_158611dd-147a-4375-a16a-565aa4f5f7de) is incredible right now, I would highly suggest picking it up if you can afford it!",
